        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average installed technology. Efficiency 0.78. Annual production volume: 190GWh/a\n\n# Included processes\nOperation of an average, certified storage hydropower station in Switzerland. It includes the area transformed and occupied, the volume of the reservoir, greenhouse gas emissions, the consumption of lubricant oil and the amount of turbined water. Not considered is the electricity used for the pumps.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
